## Domains outside the platform registry

The generated 45-platform enum is not every entity domain. The native row and More info registries explicitly reference 15 additional domains. This table maps all 15, reusing existing glossary or helper explanations where appropriate. Plant, Zone and Schedule are separately included because current guide topics use those documented integrations; they are not added to the 15-key census or the 45-platform count.

<% terms_by_id = register['terms'].to_h { |term| [term['id'], term] } %>
<table><caption>Supplementary entity-domain mapping</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Exact domain</th><th scope="col">Terminology entry</th><th scope="col">Source scope</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% register['supplemental_domain_mappings'].sort_by { |mapping| mapping['domain'] }.each do |mapping| %>
<% term = terms_by_id.fetch(mapping['entry_id']) %>
