<% end %>
</tbody></table>

A Person record can derive its state from trackers; it is not a user account or proof of a person's presence. Sun represents calculations for the configured location, not a light sensor. Plant Monitor compares configured readings and limits, not universal plant-health criteria. An alert's raw <code>off</code> state means Acknowledged while its condition can still be true. Configurator is retained as an internal legacy mechanism; it is not promoted as the general modern setup interface.

